      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nsave_audio.py - writes synthesized speech audio to a local file or object\nscript_embedding.py - Embed narration scripts for voice-asset search\nscript_safety.py - Check narration scripts for unsafe content\nscript_translate.py - Translate narration scripts before synthesis\nselect_voice.py - lists or selects a voice for a target locale\nspeech_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Text-to-Speech\nspeech_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Text-to-Speech\nsynthesize_ssml.py - synthesizes SSML with voice and prosody controls\nsynthesize_text.py - synthesizes plain text to an audio byte stream\ntts_qa_transcript.py - Transcribe synthesized QA samples to verify spoken output\n\nCreate select_voice.py in the current working directory.\nTask: lists or selects a voice for a target locale.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
